            "review_title": "Review at Gu 19 Steak",
            "review_text": "David B\n1 contribution\n0\nBest Steak joint in Hanoi\nAug 2025\nThe restaurant is on West Lake and very convenient to the Hanoi Westin Hotel. If you are “Jonesing” for a steak, this is the best place I’ve been to in Hanoi. The steak selection was very good and the sides and salads were fresh and a nice complement to the steak. The wait staff did a very good job of explaining the choices to my Asian counterparts.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 11, 2025",
