            "review_title": "Review at Gu 19 Steak",
            "review_text": "TanjungBaraDiver\nHanoi, Vietnam1974 contributions\n0\nReasonably priced quality steak in Tay Ho\nOct 2023 • Couples\nThis is a hidden away spot, almost hard to see from the road. But once inside the front doors it opens up into a pleasant restaurant. \n\nStaff are pretty good, we were quickly seated and were given some bread to start. We splurged on some foei gras (and maybe scallops?) to kick off. My wife had the lamb chops and she reckons they were OK. My Picanha was so so - just not particularly flavorsome.We washed it down with some Tiger Beer and cocktails. The cocktails were a bit ordinary but it's not really a bar so only to be expected.\n\nMostly a good place, and pretty reasonable prices for good quality steaks. Worth a visit and it's close to us so we'll probably give it another go to see if it gets any better.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 28, 2024\ngu ste\nThank you so much for your kind words 🖤 We're really glad to hear that you enjoyed the food and service at GU 19 Steak. Your satisfaction is our top priority.\nWe have upgraded and moved our house to another location with a more luxurious and cozy space with a beautiful West Lake view, which will definitely make you satisfied. We look forward to welcoming you at our new location!\nRead more\nWritten February 8, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
